(She's really enjoying it even though it feels new to her.)

1812
01:05:46,873 --> 01:05:48,102
You should do that too.

1813
01:05:48,103 --> 01:05:49,843
Mothers love doing these things.

1814
01:05:50,603 --> 01:05:52,273
Gosh, these moments shouldn't be shown to the public.

1815
01:05:54,343 --> 01:05:55,542
- This one. - Two.

1816
01:05:55,543 --> 01:05:56,583
This one.

1817
01:05:57,713 --> 01:06:00,113
This is too much work for me.

1818
01:06:00,453 --> 01:06:02,223
This is nothing.

1819
01:06:02,553 --> 01:06:04,592
You can come and take pictures after having a meal.

1820
01:06:04,593 --> 01:06:05,593
Really?

1821
01:06:05,594 --> 01:06:07,753
It can be done after having a drink.

1822
01:06:08,193 --> 01:06:11,233
It felt awkward as I have never done this before.

1823
01:06:11,533 --> 01:06:12,963
I'll come again.

1824
01:06:13,133 --> 01:06:14,633
I should come with your dad.

1825
01:06:15,503 --> 01:06:16,933
- They must really get along. - That's great.

1826
01:06:17,063 --> 01:06:19,102
After doing it once with her like this,

1827
01:06:19,103 --> 01:06:20,702
she'll do it again with her friends.

1828
01:06:20,703 --> 01:06:22,972
- Right. - She has the experience now.

1829
01:06:22,973 --> 01:06:24,872
She's been through it once.

1830
01:06:24,873 --> 01:06:25,972
- Right. - She knows how it's done.

1831
01:06:25,973 --> 01:06:27,173
It's just that mothers have never tried these things.

1832
01:06:28,043 --> 01:06:29,812
(The result of her new experience is printed out.)

1833
01:06:29,813 --> 01:06:31,513
Two copies are printed like this?

1834
01:06:31,953 --> 01:06:33,652
You have your purse.

1835
01:06:33,653 --> 01:06:35,852
- Give it to me later. - Right.

1836
01:06:35,853 --> 01:06:37,123
(Her eyes are fixed on her first four-shot photo.)

1837
01:06:37,283 --> 01:06:38,292
This is fun.

1838
01:06:38,293 --> 01:06:39,653
- We should put these back. - Okay.

1839
01:06:40,293 --> 01:06:41,562
- Okay. - Let's go.

1840
01:06:41,563 --> 01:06:42,892
Right. They should be shown to these things.

1841
01:06:42,893 --> 01:06:44,592
My mom keeps all of those safe.

1842
01:06:44,593 --> 01:06:45,993
- Right. - Right.

1843
01:06:46,433 --> 01:06:47,693
(Feeling happy)

1844
01:06:49,663 --> 01:06:51,603
- They look great. - Right.

1845
01:06:52,533 --> 01:06:54,132
(An unforgettable memory saved)

1846
01:06:54,133 --> 01:06:56,173
It looks like they wore matching shirts just for this.

1847
01:06:56,343 --> 01:06:57,472
- Right. - Right.

1848
01:06:57,473 --> 01:06:59,012
That was just a coincidence.

1849
01:06:59,013 --> 01:07:00,213
These things are great.

1850
01:07:00,473 --> 01:07:03,183
Our parents enjoy doing the things we enjoy doing.

1851
01:07:03,383 --> 01:07:05,182
- Right. - Not the things they usually do.

1852
01:07:05,183 --> 01:07:06,982
There's no need to take them...

1853
01:07:06,983 --> 01:07:08,822
to a Korean table d'hote in Insa-dong.

1854
01:07:08,823 --> 01:07:09,852
- They could just be taken to... - Right.

1855
01:07:09,853 --> 01:07:11,952
A place like a pot rice place.

1856
01:07:11,953 --> 01:07:13,022
- Trendy places? - Right.

1857
01:07:13,023 --> 01:07:14,192
They enjoy going to those places even more.

1858
01:07:14,193 --> 01:07:15,362
I'm curious about this.

1859
01:07:15,363 --> 01:07:17,363
You all must have different methods...

1860
01:07:17,463 --> 01:07:19,892
of being a good son or daughter to your parents.

1861
01:07:19,893 --> 01:07:20,993
Giving them cash.

1862
01:07:21,433 --> 01:07:23,103
Well...

1863
