You went to the ATEEZ concert.

1864
01:07:25,003 --> 01:07:26,132
- Go with my mom? - She'll be happy to go with you.

1865
01:07:26,133 --> 01:07:27,133
Right.

1866
01:07:27,134 --> 01:07:28,702
As if she would feel excited about that!

1867
01:07:28,703 --> 01:07:30,172
- She'll be happy to go with you. - My mom?

1868
01:07:30,173 --> 01:07:31,312
You think she won't like it, right? She will be happy to go with you.

1869
01:07:31,313 --> 01:07:32,372
- My mom will like ATEEZ? - She will be happy about it.

1870
01:07:32,373 --> 01:07:33,373
- Right. - Right.

1871
01:07:33,374 --> 01:07:34,442
- I got my mom concert tickets... - She never had the chance to go.

1872
01:07:34,443 --> 01:07:35,512
And she went this week.

1873
01:07:35,513 --> 01:07:38,383
I give them tickets to all of my fellow hip-hop singers concert.

1874
01:07:38,783 --> 01:07:40,382
- Really? - And they like it...

1875
01:07:40,383 --> 01:07:41,752
because they're concerts...

1876
01:07:41,753 --> 01:07:43,522
- that they normally don't go to. - That's right.

1877
01:07:43,523 --> 01:07:45,952
They like the things that only we'd like to do.

1878
01:07:45,953 --> 01:07:47,352
I should send my mom to Stray Kids' concert.

1879
01:07:47,353 --> 01:07:48,722
- She'd love it. - That's right.

1880
01:07:48,723 --> 01:07:51,062
- Seriously, do it. - She'd sing "MANIAC."

1881
01:07:51,063 --> 01:07:52,833
- Maniac - Maniac

1882
01:07:53,633 --> 01:07:55,233
What's your way of showing filial love?

1883
01:07:55,433 --> 01:07:56,833
For me, it's dining out often.

1884
01:07:57,363 --> 01:07:59,033
- That's often. - You're a good son.

1885
01:07:59,203 --> 01:08:01,203
You wouldn't just eat. You'd talk with them too.

1886
01:08:01,373 --> 01:08:04,642
Seriously. I got a comment on it...

1887
